title The fold that shrank a family to its call, and the guard bounded by a word
prompt Autonomous loop -- pick up the running thread, Standfast on reds first, take the next agent-doable lap Lindy-first crux-first on the Microkernel Target double-seat, read one council-rota doc, sweep the prose Radiant, send each finished increment as its own signed round.
think The running thread opened with the last lap's work sitting uncommitted -- caravan/reply.rye, its witness, its control, and the log all on disk, choir GREEN recorded, nothing sent. So the first act was the send that lap had earned: one signed round to origin and xykj61, before a line of new work.
think Council rota, lap index 1468 mod 27 = 10 -- foundations/20260703-182612_sameness-is-the-macro.md. It named this lap before the lap knew its own name: compress by making things publicly similar rather than by cleverness, and count the whole cost of a line saved. A fold that lifts one body into a shared harness is sameness doing exactly what that brief describes, and the four elder rungs that stayed home are the same brief refusing the clever version.
think The whole-body meter had printed the queue and reckon_the_plan led it at 2,700 lines across 37 rungs. Measured before touching anything: 37 bodies hashed byte-identical at 75 lines, four others genuinely different, and all eighteen symbols the body reaches already pub on all thirty-seven. So the fold cost no accessor -- fold L had needed one, and this one needed none.
think Re-pinning the carry meter meant reading its closing sentence, and the sentence was wrong: 137,176 lines over 10,198 bodies of 18,039, while its own assert four lines earlier said 137,185, 10,199, 18,055. Standfast -- a red found is a red booked, so the fold paused and the root came first.
think The root is not the drifted numbers. REDS %108 had built a guard for exactly this class and bounded it by a vocabulary -- a number followed by the word modules -- so the very next meter drifted on lines, bodies, and copies and stayed GREEN. A guard bounded by a word catches the incident; a guard bounded by a property catches the class.
think So the rule became: every number a ladder meter prints in a say line stands asserted in that same file, separators stripped. Subject numbers are asserted and survive; context numbers earn an assert or leave the sentence. That is checkable, needs no vocabulary, and forces prose and measurement to move on the same lap.
obs The rule proved itself twice before it was trusted. Drawn first at the closing GREEN line alone, it was too narrow within the hour -- the line directly above the carry meter's close recited the same stale number -- so it widened to every printed line. And its first pattern, an (^|[^0-9]) alternation, matched nothing at all, because this shell's grep reads a ^ inside a group as a literal caret. The probe caught that by refusing a number the file plainly asserts, which is a guard failing safe in the one direction that teaches something.
obs The fold's own number is the honest surprise. The carry fell 2,376 rather than the 2,700 the queue named, because the nine-line delegate left behind in thirty-seven rungs is itself a byte-identical copy. A fold shrinks a family to its call; it never erases it from the count. That went into the meter's header, since the next lap reading a queue number as a promised saving would be reading it wrong.
obs Two frozen controls now hold the RED path, and the new rule refuses the elder spine meter too -- on the number rather than on the noun -- so the second rule is strictly stronger than the first rather than merely beside it. That is worth more than the repair: the guard that replaced a narrow guard subsumes it.
obs The ledger's own headline tally got the same medicine on the way past. 6 + 14 + 84 had stopped summing to the row count, which the prior lap had honestly surfaced as an unmeasured question rather than booking on an impression. It is derived now -- rows minus the opening census of twenty -- so the four numbers agree by construction instead of by luck.
obs Rows 108-109 folded to crux/archive/ as row 110 was booked, the same closed-range fold the ledger has taken seven times, so the living pin stands back under its 24576 bound.
loom fold=reckon_the_plan rungs=37 body_lines=75 carried_before=2700 carried_after=324 ladder_carry_before=137185 ladder_carry_after=134809 disk_lines_before=375997 disk_lines_after=373828 accessors_added=0
file caravan/ladder_checks.rye the shared reckon_the_plan, one body reaching every symbol through the rung handed in
file caravan/abate.rye and thirty-six rung siblings each keeping a nine-line delegate where seventy-five lines stood
file tools/fixtures/caravan_ladder_carry_scan.sh the ceiling comes down 137,300 to 135,000 as the fold hands back the room it won
file tools/caravan_ladder_carry_witness.rish re-pinned to the new measurement, its close carrying no number the file does not assert
file tools/fixtures/caravan_ladder_prose_count_scan.sh the second rule -- every printed number stands asserted in the same file
file tools/fixtures/caravan_ladder_prose_close_elder/caravan_ladder_carry_witness.rish the drifted meter frozen exactly as it shipped, a control that cannot repair itself
file tools/caravan_ladder_copy_witness.rish RED path twelve registered, and the elder spine line refused by the new rule too
file crux/REDS.md REDS %110 booked and closed, rows 108-109 folded, the headline tally derived rather than recited
file crux/CAIRNS.md the walk-back before the card's two live-edge bullets condensed
file caravan/README.md fold N and the red it walked into, in one section
file crux/REMEMBER.md live edge rotated to fold N, the reply and edge bullets condensed to a pointer
recommend keep-going The printed queue names the next fold and it is ungated: fill_table leads at 2,484 lines across 37 rungs, with provision_notes at 2,093 across 24 and confer_one at 2,067 across 40 behind it. fill_table is the better crux of the three -- fold M already widened it to public for exactly this, so the ground is prepared. The one gate worth Keaton's eye stays small and unchanged: jinja2 and ply on the pier's Python environment open types.h, syscalls.h, bootinfo.h, faults.h, and the sel4.h umbrella in a single step, which is an environment change and so his word.
